[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11340.389, "timestamp": "03:09:00", "text": "向下。全部内容都在“显示全部”选项下。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11343.03, "timestamp": "03:09:03", "text": "全部按钮。如果你点击它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11345.269, "timestamp": "03:09:05", "text": "哦好的。好的。保存。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11348.469, "timestamp": "03:09:08", "text": "它看起来会和其他东西一样。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11349.75, "timestamp": "03:09:09", "text": "只会添加一个，但如果你点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11353.11, "timestamp": "03:09:13", "text": "其他方面，它应该显示为类似“额外”之类的字样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11355.59, "timestamp": "03:09:15", "text": "子资产也是如此。但是，再说一遍，不要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11357.349, "timestamp": "03:09:17", "text": "想太多了。还有，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.59, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "可以禁用重印功能并禁用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11361.99, "timestamp": "03:09:21", "text": "下面那些喽啰。清除"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11363.59, "timestamp": "03:09:23", "text": "主要能力及其他。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11366.95, "timestamp": "03:09:26", "text": "清除这些。如果你点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11369.269, "timestamp": "03:09:29", "text": "保存后，应该会显示更多内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11370.23, "timestamp": "03:09:30", "text": "也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11372.309, "timestamp": "03:09:32", "text": "啊，是的。好的，这是来自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11374.469, "timestamp": "03:09:34", "text": "不同版本，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11376.63, "timestamp": "03:09:36", "text": "但别太担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11377.75, "timestamp": "03:09:37", "text": "好的，明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11379.349, "timestamp": "03:09:39", "text": "如果你这样做，情况可能会变得有点复杂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11381.12, "timestamp": "03:09:41", "text": "你不知道自己在做什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11382.87, "timestamp": "03:09:42", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11384.389, "timestamp": "03:09:44", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11386.95, "timestamp": 